[{"title":"乙巳岁除日收周茂叔虞曹武昌惠书知已赴官零陵丙午正月内成十诗奉寄 其九","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"宗邑祅灾并，无如旧岁多。\n凶霖浸宫阙，涌水注江河。\n鬼盛天为疫，阴强雪荐瘥。\n知君忧国甚，搔首只吟哦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41551,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙巳岁除日收周茂叔虞曹武昌惠书知已赴官零陵丙午正月内成十诗奉寄 其十","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"诗社久零落，所传毛郑馀。\n先生守章句，后辈老虫鱼。\n大义谁窥觑，微言尚阔疏。\n烦君来就索，但恨未成书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41552,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖诗 将废西园开南湖先谕老圃","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"拟作南湖当北湖，劝教老圃罢耕锄。\n此间有景待垂钓，何处无田可种蔬。\n长夏便应浮藻荇，高亭行看走龟鱼。\n秋风一棹荷花里，醉卧烟波欲自如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41553,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖诗 昝司万参军甄盘虢略主簿何殊南湖种柳植莲","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"绕岸便须多种柳，满湖仍为遍栽莲。\n长条翠盖成阴日，我欲移舟处处眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41554,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖诗 谕甄何二君于南湖诸亭筑孤屿","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"孤屿莫教闲草占，诸亭还向四边开。\n凉天我欲携樽酒，同与清风白月来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41555,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖诗 讽甄何二君南湖养鱼","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"剩将鳣鲔散南湖，一细千鳞已有馀。\n传舍客来须纵食，莫教弹剑叹无鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41556,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖诗 调甄何二君于南湖创小舟","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"细编青篾高为盖，密斗朱栏大作船。\n准拟使君清兴发，银笙玉笛醉红莲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41557,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新开湖诗 讽甄何二君于南湖架梯桥过渚亭","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"桥须跨水三千尺，路要梯横数百层。\n会有赤松来过我，待从此处共飞腾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41558,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"通天岩","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"幽怀慕岭寂，结庵在中林。\n绿竹君子操，清池故人心。\n明月弄寒影，好风摇翠阴。\n江南千里远，何处盛朋簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41559,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题徐冲晦处士旧隐","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"冲晦先生不肯官，布衣谒帝布衣还。\n尚嫌姓字腾人口，惟恐文章落世间。\n大隐不妨居市井，高吟何处问家山。\n平生寄意江湖上，云自无心水自闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41560,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九龙岩 其一","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"虚岩苍壁古苔斑，潇洒清深六月寒。\n三伏流金无处避，暮天将去更盘桓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41561,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九龙岩 其二","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"老僧栖息乱云颠，凿石开山四十年。\n投得岩成身老大，更无筋力到岩前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41562,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九龙岩 其三","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"人言道士隐深山，九炼丹成去不还。\n乳溜滴成华盖座，犹疑真相在岩间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41563,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九龙岩 其四","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"欲寻微径到山前，闻有蛟龙洞底眠。\n岁旱密云终不雨，可能无意救荒年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41564,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄蕲簟","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"公家列屋閒娥眉，珠帘不动花荫移。\n云帐银床初破睡，牙签玉轴坐弹棋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41565,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"收书万卷日沈酣，鲍谢诗篇老更耽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41566,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"圣名不敢居，民誉日益美。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41567,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"蒲宗孟","text":"阆州胜绝是云台，十里松萝殿阁开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41568,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钓台","author":"鲁有开","text":"昔日狂奴向此来，爱垂芳饵上崔嵬。\n乡人不识钓台意，空指山头是钓台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41569,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞","author":"鲁有开","text":"马蹄清晓破蓝田，一出红尘骨已仙。\n任锁九重山下路，终寻五处洞中天。\n泉流碧砌长鸣玉，迹隐苍崖久蜕蝉。\n人世归时知变否，樵夫曾记烂柯年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41570,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李谊伯","text":"截开野色教天阔，斫断浮云放日高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41571,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放隐斋落成寄鲁直九侄","author":"黄序","text":"直木皆先伐，轮囷却岁寒。\n时沾病者粟，倒著挂时冠。\n人乐观鱼尾，山斋跨马鞍。\n朝中乞佳句，留与子孙看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41572,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲华池","author":"黄中庸","text":"莲花瓣里可撑船，一月映成水一川。\n人把水心和月净，莲花贮月水倾船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41573,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢章子厚","author":"刘定","text":"故人天上有书来，责我疏愚唤不回。\n两处共瞻千里月，十年不寄一枝梅。\n尘泥自与云霄隔，驽马难追德骥才。\n莫谓无心向门下，也曾终夕望三台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41574,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游齐山招提二首 其一","author":"刘定","text":"楼迥山饶翠，湖平水漫黄。\n开帘无午暑，隔洞有秋香。\n冰枕聊相慰，云帆亦未忙。\n月明与溪色，好在紫微郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41575,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游齐山招提二首 其二","author":"刘定","text":"忆上青萝磴，流年三十三。\n僧人头似雪，寺坦竹如蓝。\n萧使登高石，吴公守隐岩。\n清风殊未远，咫尺看云岚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41576,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望江亭","author":"陈传","text":"山蔼峨峨江岸深，望馀亭影落江心。\n无风万里磨平玉，有月千波漾碎金。\n思远解邀无己句，流清宜写不齐琴。\n仙槎一棹惊秋晓，此去银河尚几寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41577,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠颜象环","author":"陈传","text":"初与田蔬一样平，一千年后插天青。\n行人息荫凉风下，应说栽松道士名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41578,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佐郎将","author":"陈传","text":"林中生致佐郎将，名王头颅十四五。\n乾德可禽嗟不谋，同恶相济能包羞。\n降书冉冉过中州，中军传呼笑点头。\n蛮首算成勿药喜，君臣称觞弭多垒。\n元戎凯旋隔天水，夜经桄榔趋决里。\n驱将十万人性命，换得交州数张纸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41579,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"众乐亭 其一","author":"陈汝羲","text":"闻说湖亭又一新，不徒行乐乐斯民。\n水光剩占鸥鹇地，人意常同桃李春。\n试展画图清俗眼，况专閒席傲天真。\n使君已陟螭头贵，应为烟云入梦频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41580,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"众乐亭 其二","author":"陈汝羲","text":"遥思湖上自由春，醉踏吟看属使君。\n水底天光开静鉴，岸头花气递红云。\n岛浮虚槛桥桥接，风翼时钟寺寺闻。\n渍墨新名人会否，不将民乐废民勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41581,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"周师厚","text":"有眼不堪看郑獬，回头犹喜得陈传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41582,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建溪","author":"郑叔明","text":"水色山光表里清，野花溪柳意相迎。\n狂歌惊鹭滩头散，攲枕看云岭上生。\n峰曲转帆疑路尽，潭深飞棹觉舟轻。\n归程渐喜乡关近，竹户枫林鸡犬声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41583,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"何琬","text":"贺老溪山久寂寥，辍从青琐去班条。\n楼台爽气来蓬岛，鼓角新声压海潮。\n千里劝耕趋垄亩，五云吟句落渔樵。\n鉴湖想望隋河上，满眼清风逐画桡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41584,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"吕大忠","text":"飞诏平明走玉珂，夕郎持节越山阿。\n西风旗鼓催行色，南国莼鲈助醉歌。\n邻寇未销谋可尔，部氓犹困政如何。\n番禺今得长城利，推此求功曲突多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41585,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞","author":"张献民","text":"文脊佳峰峦，烟云密帷幕。\n穷深到幽处，无路通马脚。\n天意忽芜没，神功为开凿。\n周环列苍石，直上撑碧落。\n伏暑坐其下，凛凛风霜作。\n俗客频往来，只恐却锁钥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41586,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 山门","author":"张献民","text":"无路可通文脊隈，山腰大辟门崔嵬。\n若非天地功破裂，定是鬼神力凿开。\n浑浑旁撑苍壁立，空空直贯清风来。\n祇应便彻仙源去，愿蹑飞云到玉台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41587,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 朝阳洞","author":"张献民","text":"撇衣秉火扪石入，路硬硗确黑如漆。\n穷深不见瞿硎生，洞中依旧石藏室。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41588,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 涟漪洞","author":"张献民","text":"洞流何处窟穴断，泉向洞中源源生。\n潺潺万古流不尽，夜夜空照山月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41589,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 碧云洞","author":"张献民","text":"一窦险若到平处，裂壁忽见天共明。\n水深不敢投石响，潭中惟恐神龙惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41590,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 其一 紫云岩","author":"张献民","text":"朝见紫云生霏霏，暮见紫云归戢戢。\n有时飞鸾舞上下，料是仙人潜出入。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41591,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 其二 紫云岩","author":"张献民","text":"日破阴蒙照岩顶，紫云一片拖晴影。\n溶溶泄泄晚不收，只疑便是壶中景。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41592,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 其一 夕阳岩","author":"张献民","text":"屹嵲欲到倚山脚，涵云泄雨摩半空。\n向晚呀然射颓照，叠石烂烂参差红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41593,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门六题寄圣俞 其二 夕阳岩","author":"张献民","text":"岩下夕阳烛已然，岩腰斜照光犹射。\n暮云残霭不能遮，始信仙居无昼夜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41594,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"楼郁","text":"五经高阁倚云开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41595,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎丘","author":"王绅","text":"山头古寺多陈迹，故国空馀气象雄。\n霸业已随流水去，阖闾坟草又西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41596,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后生日","author":"王绅","text":"太皇生日最尊荣，献寿宫中未五更。\n天子捧觞仍再拜，宝慈侍立到天明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41597,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太后幸景灵宫驾前露面双童女","author":"王绅","text":"平明綵仗幸琳宫，紫府仙童下九重。\n整顿珑璁时驻马，画工暗地貌真容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41598,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题干越亭送石秘校诗后","author":"张挺卿","text":"宛陵梅夫子，才名冠当世。\n欧苏与并驱，时称天下士。\n哲人去已久，手泽见英气。\n可慕不可攀，悠悠千古意。\n行义鲁臧孙，流芳垂后裔。\n今遇叔章君，箕裘元不坠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41599,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝岩师酒","author":"王无咎","text":"腊去东风渐破春，凭轩怅望倍凝神。\n鸟鸣晓霁声音乐，物被阳和气候新。\n佳景牵怀吟稍遍，芳杯到手举宜频。\n灵均空诧离骚好，憔悴终为独醒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41600,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"麻姑山","author":"王无咎","text":"仙軿昔日此留连，气象辽辽尚宛然。\n溪落断崖为远瀑，路从绝顶见平田。\n千年芝有灵禽戏，一洞云留羽客眠。\n已乐胜游尘境外，况陪清论酒尊前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41601,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"国清寺","author":"李元凯","text":"智者高踪接沃洲，石渠仙职我同游。\n已无月桂笼禅室，犹有祥云锁寺楼。\n叠砌崚嶒封碧藓，五峰苍翠覆寒流。\n却缘王命相拘束，不得跻攀最上头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41602,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝命偈","author":"张宗旦","text":"法本心生，心因法昧。\n有觉于此，是名自在。\n自在真空，顿然明彻。\n去住寻常，晓然春雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41603,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋新繁周表权如诏亭","author":"刘孝孙","text":"义方曾榜旧亭名，子已为郎典要城。\n身服上恩今日显，诏符前语是人惊。\n正如伯起鳣堂兆，兼胜于公驷阀荣。\n试问繁江诸父老，诗书何似宝金籯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41604,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"刘季孙","text":"诗书鲁国真男子，歌吹扬州作贵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41605,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"陈侗","text":"夕郎乡思满江皋，昼锦东归意气豪。\n侯国台门牙戟盛，使君楼艓隼旟高。\n琐窗暮入曾批敕，仙殿晨趋罢染毫。\n曲水春风修禊饮，卧龙山雨望秋涛。\n番禺已有金汤惠，秦望应先衮綍褒。\n莫恋蓬莱便栖志，伫看拂拭吕虔刀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41606,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题东老庵","author":"陈侗","text":"我昔名东老，君能老此庵。\n溪风开梵帙，岩月伴庄谈。\n世味閒无著，人情晚更谙。\n萧然尘外意，回首谢图南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41607,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄王微之","author":"傅尧俞","text":"当利江头最僻州，怀人惟是数登楼。\n绿樽连日不成宴，飞盖满城无旧游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41608,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书","author":"傅尧俞","text":"吾屋虽諠卑，颇不甚芜秽。\n置席屋中间，坐卧群书内。\n横风吹急雨，入屋洒我背。\n展卷殊未知，心与古人会。\n有客自外来，笑我苦痴昧。\n且问何为尔，我初尚不对。\n强我不得已，起答客亦退。\n聊复得此心，沾湿安足悔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41609,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"傅尧俞","text":"此时廊庙联三省，它日貂蝉定两公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41610,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释法演","text":"皖伯台前送别时，桃花如锦柳如眉。\n明年此日凭栏看，依旧青青一两枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41611,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其一","author":"释法演","text":"幸然无一事，行脚要参禅。\n却被禅相恼，不透祖师关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41612,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其二","author":"释法演","text":"难难几何般，易易没巴鼻。\n好好催人老，默默从此得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41613,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其三","author":"释法演","text":"此个物，上拄天，下拄地。\n皖口作眼，皖山作鼻。\n太平退身三步，放你诸人出气。\n太平淈髿汉，事事尽经遍。\n如是三十年，也有人赞叹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41614,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其四","author":"释法演","text":"白云不会说禅，三门开向两边。\n有人动著关捩，两片东扇西扇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41615,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其五","author":"释法演","text":"悟了同未悟，归家寻旧路。\n一字是一字，一句是一句。\n自小不脱空，两岁学移步。\n湛水生莲花，一年生一度。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41616,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其六","author":"释法演","text":"花发鸡冠媚早秋，谁人能染紫丝头。\n有时风动频相倚，似向阶前斗不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41617,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈七首 其七","author":"释法演","text":"佛祖生冤家，悟道染泥土。\n无为无事人，声色如聋瞽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41618,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释法演","text":"华种有生姓，因地华生生。\n大缘与性合，当生生不生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41619,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释楚文","text":"华藏木榔栗，等闲乱拈出。\n不是不惜手，山家无固必。\n点山山动摇，搅水水波溢。\n忽然把定时，事事执法律。\n要横不得横，要屈不得屈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41620,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"福安寺","author":"闵希声","text":"骖鹤凌空载旧经，至今风月有馀清。\n轩窗物外无尘到，芝朮香中作眼明。\n沙鸟宛疑凫?翥，露蜂犹学玉箫声。\n高僧不厌庸人扰，煮茗欣颜每见近。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41621,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"往凤凰院观稼","author":"吴几复","text":"使旌巡稼欲观农，赏景留宾大衮东。\n溪锁豹眠闲雾露，台雕凤集旧梧桐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41622,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"吴几复","text":"苍石皱文龙迹在，清泉涵泳海源通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41623,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]